        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/{size}/1939_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-15T02:41:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This question is directed more at GtG. So I've been screencapping and printing out the spirit boards and unique powers for Serpent, Wildfire, and Ocean to supplement my PnP spirits. So far, only the spirit panels for Thunderspeaker and Rampant Green have been revealed by means of the two sets of videos Chris Burton made (I think I spelled your name wrong before, sorry). Is it alright if I ask a playtester what the unique power cards are for Rampant Green and Thunderspeaker? I wanted to check with GtG first, because if it is a grey area I didn't want to put any playtesters in an awkward situation.</p><p>I also decided to post this here rather than PM someone in case others were wondering the same thing. I totally understand if they cannot reveal this information, I would just like to be able to play with as many spirits as possible while I wait for the official release and the Events deck that's coming with it.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:40.233Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
